message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Spinor Corrections b-C & a-C and the Choptyuk Problem"
authors:
  - family-names: "Isaev"
    given-names: "Ishak Khamzatovich"
    email: "aslan08_05@mail.ru"
    orcid: ""
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-07
repository-code: "https://github.com/wild8highlander/choptuik_ac_bc"
abstract: >
  Computational verification and simulation of spinor corrections b-C (Berry, 1st order)
  and a-C (braking, 2nd order) on the Klein quartic curve, with the unified Choptyuk
  formula. Includes enumeration of all 64 spinor structures, applications to Bolza/Bring
  surfaces, and LIGO/Virgo quasi-normal mode predictions.
keywords:
  - "spinor correction"
  - "Klein quartic"
  - "Choptyuk formula"
  - "Dirac operator"
  - "Lichnerowicz formula"
  - "PSL(2,7)"
  - "quasi-normal modes"
  - "gravitational waves"
